    "answer": {
      "short": "$(3\\ln 3-2)\\text{ units}^2$",
      "worked": "Change the limits:\n$$\\begin{align*}y=1:&\\quad x=\\ln 1=0\\\\y=3:&\\quad x=\\ln 3\\end{align*}$$\nThe bounding rectangle has height $3$ and width $\\ln 3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{rectangle}}&=3\\ln 3\\\\A_{\\text{under curve}}&=\\int_0^{\\ln 3}e^x\\,dx\\\\&=[e^x]_0^{\\ln 3}\\\\&=3-1\\\\&=2\\\\A_{\\text{required}}&=3\\ln 3-2\\text{ units}^2\\end{align*}$$",
